# Build context of docker/Dockerfile (`docker build -f docker/Dockerfile .`),
# which copies everything not listed here. Patterns match paths from the
# context root: `**/target/` is every target directory, including those of
# nested checkouts such as the worktrees under .claude/.
**/target/
.claude/
.git/
*.md
!crates/aranet-service/README.md
docs/
website/
dashboards/
scripts/
distribution/
.github/
# Local files that .gitignore keeps out too: secrets and coverage output.
**/.env*
**/*.profraw
**/*.profdata
coverage/
lcov.info
